	(text "OOMWOO side sensor board (rev 2, 2026-10-27), right side of the robot. U8401 and U8402 both look out\nof the board face (top-looking parts). The main board holds the I2C pull-ups (2.2k); this board has the\nXSHUT and GPIO1 pull-ups. Firmware: the I/Os run at 3.3 V = AVDD, so set the VL53L0X API to 2V8 I/O mode.\nRefs 84xx: unique on the OOMWOO panel."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d87c3d23-d2f9-4de7-91f0-e0c60d5bb93e")
	)
